{
  "name": "triage_reporter_not_counted",
  "description": "RC2 member roles: check runs are trusted only from maintainers, role-1 writers and runners. A run by a triage member (a writer demoted after posting it; consensus refuses a triage member's new run) is not counted and does not shadow the trusted run before it.",
